        <h2 class="h4">Description</h2>

        <p>
          A rich and warm fragrance built around oud, with soft amber and a hint of
          spice. Long-lasting and perfect for evenings and special occasions.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Size: 100 ml</li>
          <li>Type: Eau de Parfum</li>
          <li>Notes: Oud, Amber, Spice</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Oud Royale opens with a bright touch of saffron and bergamot, then settles into a deep heart of oud wood and rose. The base is amber, vanilla and a little musk, which keeps the scent close to the skin for hours. It is made for evenings, weddings and special occasions.</p>
        <p>Each 100 ml bottle is an Eau de Parfum with a concentration of about 18 percent, so two or three sprays are enough for a full day. Spray on pulse points such as the wrists and neck, and avoid rubbing the skin afterwards.</p>
        <p>Top notes: saffron, bergamot, cardamom. Heart notes: oud wood, rose, cinnamon. Base notes: amber, vanilla, white musk, sandalwood.</p>
        <p>Store the bottle in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Heat and light slowly change the fragrance, so a drawer or a shelf inside a room is better than a bathroom or a car.</p>
        <p>Delivery is available across Pakistan with cash on delivery. Orders above Rs. 5,000 ship free. Every bottle is 100 percent original and sealed in its box.</p>
        <p>Longevity: 8 to 10 hours on skin and more than a day on clothes. Sillage: moderate to strong in the first two hours, then soft and close.</p>
        <p>Best seasons: autumn and winter, although it also works on cool summer evenings. For a lighter day wear, spray once on the wrists only.</p>
        <p>Gift idea: Oud Royale comes in a sturdy box, so it makes a good gift for Eid, weddings and birthdays. A single bottle is usually enough to last three to four months with regular use.</p>
